@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title after_event tracker staged with the VM scan
participant "Runtime host\n(ControlRuntime)" as Host
participant "Rust AfterEventRuntime\n(WASM)" as AE
participant "Rust VM" as VM
Host -> AE : stage explicit event facts\nand measured predicate observations
AE --> Host : Rust-owned any/all results
Host -> VM : scan with results on private\ngenerated Result inputs
alt VM scan commits
  VM --> Host : committed
  Host -> AE : commit tracker state
else VM scan rejected
  VM --> Host : rejected
  Host -> AE : roll back tracker state
end
@enduml
